OL,3,GNEWSACovid death probe told of rescue
OL,4,Abid to get North Sea worker ashore
OL,5,
OL,6,FA North Sea offshore worker who later
OL,7,Fdied from Covid had to be evacuated
OL,8,Fashore by rescue helicopter as his
OL,9,Fcondition deteriorated, an inquiry has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FDonald Singer, 66, from Aberdeen, was a
OL,13,Fcrane operator working on the Ninian
OL,14,FSouthern platform off Shetland.
OL,16,FHe was airlifted by helicopter on 3
OL,17,FApril 2020, and died a month later on 4
OL,18,FMay at Aberdeen Royal Infirmary.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
