OL,3,GNEWSACovid death probe told of rescue
OL,4,Abid to get North Sea worker ashore
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitness Adam Whittaker told the first
OL,7,Fday of a fatal accident inquiry (FAI)
OL,8,Fthat his colleague had been in
OL,9,Finsolation on the platform as a
OL,10,Fprecaution with some, but not all, of
OL,11,Fthe symptoms of Covid.
